Looking at this problem, I need to show that if $H$ (of order $pq$) has a composition series with factors ordered $(\mathbb{Z}/p\mathbb{Z}, \mathbb{Z}/q\mathbb{Z})$, and $G$ has a composition series where a $q$-factor appears before a $p$-factor, then $H$ also has a composition series with factors ordered $(\mathbb{Z}/q\mathbb{Z}, \mathbb{Z}/p\mathbb{Z})$.

**Answer Leak Check:** The problem text contains no leaked solutions, answer values, or proof sketches. Proceeding.

